<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mercantile Bankshares cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mercantile Bankshares cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co LLC said on Wednesday it lowered its rating on the shares of Mercantile Bankshares Corp to a hold from a buy, based on valuation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Katrina Blecher said in a research note that Mercantile was an excellent institution, but no longer undervalued on a multiple basis.</p>
<p>-- The company reported second quarter earnings of $0.46 per share compared to $0.40 per share in the year ago, in line with Blecher's estimate, she said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/8 to 28-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk 212 859-1730))</p>
